OL,3,AAt least 12 killed in Kyiv as Ukraine
OL,4,Agrapples with air defence shortages
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 12 people have been killed and
OL,7,F34 injured in the latest Russian
OL,8,Fstrikes targeting the Ukrainian
OL,9,Fcapital, as Kyiv continues to face a
OL,10,Fshortage of air defence missiles.
OL,12,FApartment blocks and warehouses were
OL,13,Fstruck across the city overnight, the
OL,14,FState Emergency Service of Ukraine
OL,15,F(DSNS) said, while a children's
OL,16,Fhospital and school were also damaged.
OL,18,FThe Russian defence ministry said it
OL,19,Fused air, land and sea-based weapons to
OL,20,Ftarget military facilities and
OL,21,Fwarehouses, adding that 726 Ukrainian
OL,22,Fdrones had been shot down.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
