OL,3,AAt least 12 killed in Kyiv as Ukraine
OL,4,Agrapples with air defence shortages
OL,5,
OL,6,FUkrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky
OL,7,Fsaid the deaths were the result of a
OL,8,Fshortage of air defence missiles, which
OL,9,FKyiv relies on western allies to
OL,10,Fsupply.
